  ✓ ai              off (ai.enabled: false)
  ✓ telegram        off (set AJAI_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN and AJAI_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID …
  ✓ resume          ~/resumes/cv.pdf
  ✓ data dir        ~
